      "value": "High quality one of a kind custom-made Cobalt Wedding Band with Natural Genuine Princess Cut Diamond Gemstone. 8mm Matte Finish Black Ion Plated with Yellow Gold Ion Plated Stepped Edge Trim Comfort Fit Cobalt Wedding Band. Mens Cobalt Ring, Engagement Ring, Anniversary Ring."
