    {
      "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER",
      "language_tag": "en_US",
      "value": "Highly scratch & wear resistant (NOT scratch proof). 5x harder than 18K gold and a bit harder than titanium. Cobalt rings are very durable in wear and a great choice for men's wedding rings. This ring is not resizable."
